### NativeWind → Web Tailwind Translation

Tailwind classes are **identical** after the preset is wired. The only differences are HTML elements and layout primitives:

| Mobile (NativeWind)            | Web (Tailwind)                          |
| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- |
| `<View>`                       | `<div>`                                 |
| `<Text>`                       | `<p>`, `<span>`, `<h1>`–`<h4>`, etc.   |
| `<ScrollView>`                 | `<div class="overflow-y-auto">` or page scroll |
| `<FlatList horizontal>`        | `<div class="flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto">` |
| `<FlatList>` (vertical)        | `<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">`     |
| `<FlameImage source={{ uri }}>` | `<Image>` from `next/image`            |
| `flex-1` (full height fill)    | `min-h-screen` or `w-full`             |
| `SafeAreaView` / insets        | Ignored on web                          |
| `<Pressable>`                  | `<button>` or `<a>`                    |
| `@expo/vector-icons` Feather   | `react-icons/fi` (FiCalendar, etc.)    |

### Mandatory Design System Rules (Pre-Submit Checklist)

These are **not nitpicks** — all must pass before merging:

| Check | Rule |
| ----- | ---- |
| No `style={}` | Use Tailwind classes (`mt-[50px]` not `style={{ marginTop: 50 }}`). Exception: rare cases Tailwind cannot express (e.g. complex `clip-path`). |
| No hardcoded hex | Use `bg-surface` not `#08131A`. Check token table above first. |
| Icons: `react-icons` only | No inline SVG. Use `FiCalendar`, `FiMapPin`, etc. from `react-icons/fi` (Feather), `react-icons/io5` (Ionicons), `react-icons/si` (brand logos). |
| Images: `next/image` only | No raw `<img>`. Use `next/image` with `sizes` and `alt`. |
| Tailwind classes only | No CSS module classes. No legacy `flame-*` class names. |
| 800px container on all sections | `max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4` — no exceptions. |

### Web vs Mobile Structural Differences

| Feature | Mobile | Web |
| ------- | ------ | --- |
| Navigation | Bottom tab bar (`CustomTabBar`) | Persistent top Navbar |
| Home footer | Not present | Present (iOS links to it) |
| Image component | `<FlameImage>` (expo-image) | `<Image>` from `next/image` |
| Icons | `@expo/vector-icons` (Feather, Ionicons) | `react-icons` (fi, io5, si) |
| Font loading | Expo font loaders (`Poppins_600SemiBold`) | Google Fonts in `layout.tsx` |
| Sticky bottom CTA | `CheckoutCTA` inline, floating pill | Inline pill + floating "Buy Tickets" pill |
| Safe area insets | `useSafeAreaInsets()` | Not needed |

### Legacy vs Active Mobile Screens

Always port the **active** mobile screen. Never port legacy screens.

| Mobile file | Status | Web equivalent |
| ----------- | ------ | -------------- |
| `apps/mobile/app/(tabs)/index.tsx` → `HomeFeedList` | ✅ ACTIVE | `apps/web/app/page.tsx` |
| `apps/mobile/components/home/LegacyHomeContent.tsx` | ❌ LEGACY — do NOT port | — |
| `apps/mobile/app/events.tsx` → `EventsScreenBody` | ✅ ACTIVE | `apps/web/app/events/page.tsx` |
| `apps/mobile/app/(tabs)/dashboard.tsx` | ✅ ACTIVE | `apps/web/app/account/` |
| `apps/mobile/app/(tabs)/org-dashboard.tsx` | ✅ ACTIVE | `apps/web/app/organizer/` |
